# #356: a file whose org: is not W3C's Organization ontology.
@prefix org: <http://example.org/myorg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/myorg> a owl:Ontology .
org:Team a owl:Class .
org:secret a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain org:Team .
